  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;If <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous as well as differentiable for all <math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then"
  },
